L000475	The experiment was performed at the COoler SYnchrotron (COSY) at Forschungszentrum Jülich, utilizing the standard COSY infrastructure along with the rf Wien filter \cite{Slim:2016pim}, a superconducting Siberian snake \cite{Lehrach:556296,Lehrach:826216}, the solenoid of the 2-MV e-cooler, and the JEDI Polarimeter (JePo) \cite{Mueller_2020} (see Fig.~\ref{fig:cosy}).
L000476	Results from beam-based alignment~\cite{Wagner_2021} and a dedicated geodetic survey of the ring magnets
